id=dirtysepbypass
name=DirtySepolicy Bypass
version=v4.0.0
versionCode=40000
author=local
description=Defeats DirtySepolicy up to v2.2 and the Duck-Detector probe set. Intercepts selinuxfs access/status/context/policy and libselinux APIs, serves scrubbed /proc/self maps/smaps/status/comm, linker solists, fd links and env vars so ordinary apps cannot find the Zygisk injection, and drops leaking AVC audit records from __android_log_* and logcat streams (ZN-AuditPatch style, without ZygiskNext).
updateJson=
